          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 103001,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari cara membuat <strong>arrow function</strong>. Fitur ini merupakan bagian dari standar JavaScript ES6 dan digunakan untuk menulis kode yang lebih rapi dan singkat.</p><p>Mari tulis ulang fungsi di bawah ini sebagai arrow function hanya dengan satu baris kode.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hello'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const greeting = () =&gt; 'Hi';</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari cara membuat <strong>arrow function</strong>. Fitur ini merupakan bagian dari standar JavaScript ES6 dan digunakan untuk menulis kode yang lebih rapi dan singkat.</p><p>Mari tulis ulang fungsi di bawah ini sebagai arrow function hanya dengan satu baris kode.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hello'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const greeting = () =&gt; 'Hi';</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Anonymous Function",
            "id": 103846,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow function adalah jenis <strong>fungsi</strong><strong>anonim</strong>, yang berarti fungsi tersebut tidak memiliki nama fungsi.</p><p>Jika kita ingin memanggil fungsi-fungsi ini, kita perlu menyimpannya di dalam variabel lalu memanggil variabel tersebut dengan tanda kurung di bagian akhir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const greeting</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>greeting()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow function adalah jenis <strong>fungsi</strong><strong>anonim</strong>, yang berarti fungsi tersebut tidak memiliki nama fungsi.</p><p>Jika kita ingin memanggil fungsi-fungsi ini, kita perlu menyimpannya di dalam variabel lalu memanggil variabel tersebut dengan tanda kurung di bagian akhir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const greeting</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>greeting()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parentheses",
            "id": 103847,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan arrow function, kita tidak memerlukan keyword <code>function</code> atau nama fungsi. Artinya, hal pertama yang kita mulai adalah tanda kurung.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameter",
            "id": 103848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seperti pada fungsi biasa, kita bisa menambahkan parameter di dalam tanda kurung, lalu menggunakan parameter tersebut di dalam fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting(\" /><text value=\"'Tony'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Tony\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>firstName</code>, diikuti oleh <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seperti pada fungsi biasa, kita bisa menambahkan parameter di dalam tanda kurung, lalu menggunakan parameter tersebut di dalam fungsi.</p><p>Gunakan nama parameter yang sama seperti fungsi biasa dan kembalikan sapaan yang dibuat dari argumen tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting(\" /><text value=\"'Tony'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Tony'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Tony\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>firstName</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>, dan terakhir <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow operator",
            "id": 103004,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tepat setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka, tambahkan operator arrow <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><p>Kita menggunakan operator ini tepat sebelum blok kode atau ekspresi yang ingin dijalankan oleh fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hello = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" helloArrowFunction = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hello());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(helloArrowFunction());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Greetings \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tepat setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka, tambahkan operator arrow <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><p>Kita menggunakan operator ini tepat sebelum blok kode atau ekspresi yang ingin dijalankan oleh fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hello = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" helloArrowFunction = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hello());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(helloArrowFunction());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Greetings \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103005,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sama seperti pada fungsi tradisional, kita menggunakan kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> untuk memuat blok kode fungsi arrow.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"'Elizabeth'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>};</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sama seperti pada fungsi tradisional, kita menggunakan kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> untuk memuat blok kode fungsi arrow.</p><p>Lengkapi blok dan kembalikan sapaan menggunakan variabel lokal <code>name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"'Elizabeth'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetings\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name</code>, dan terakhir <code>};</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One body statement",
            "id": 103006,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika arrow function hanya memiliki satu pernyataan, kita bisa menghilangkan kurung kurawal dan keyword <code>return</code> untuk mendapatkan kode yang sangat singkat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return 'Greetings' }\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>'Greetings'</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika arrow function hanya memiliki satu pernyataan, kita bisa menghilangkan kurung kurawal dan keyword <code>return</code> untuk mendapatkan kode yang sangat singkat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return 'Greetings' }\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>greetings</code>, diikuti oleh <code>'Greetings'</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Arrow operator",
            "id": 103700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di mana kita menambahkan operator panah <code>=&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setelah kata kunci <code>function</code> dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka <code>{</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu mulai membuat arrow function yang menerima <code>name</code>. Fragmen mana yang menghubungkan daftar parameternya ke blok kode dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>(name) =&gt; {</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=&gt; (name) {</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>(name) { =&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(name) =&gt; {</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa fungsi kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> dalam arrow function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok tersebut berisi kodenya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini digunakan untuk memanggil fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok tersebut berisi kodenya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam <code>const getScore = () =&gt; { return 10; };</code>, bagian mana yang dimuat oleh kurung kurawal arrow function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return 10;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>() =&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>getScore()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return 10;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One body statement",
            "id": 103702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita bisa mempersingkat kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menghapus kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> dan kata kunci <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan menghapus tanda kurung <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menghapus kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> dan kata kunci <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin mempersingkat fungsi ini, tetapi fungsi tersebut tetap harus mengembalikan <code>\"Hello\"</code>. Pengganti mana yang memberikan hasil yang sama?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; \"Hello\";</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const greetings = =&gt; \"Hello\";</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; { \"Hello\"; };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; \"Hello\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 103704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara kita memanggil arrow function berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" position = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello Jane!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>greetings();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>greetings;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>greetings();</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu perlu menjalankan <code>greetings</code> dan menyimpan teks yang dikembalikannya dalam <code>message</code>. Baris mana yang melakukannya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" position = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello Jane!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const message = greetings();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const message = greetings;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const message = greetings.position;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const message = greetings();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parenthesis",
            "id": 103706,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi arrow function.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getVehicleCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"4003\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getVehicleCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4003\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi arrow function.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getVehicleCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"4003\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getVehicleCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4003\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>getVehicleCount</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Arrow operator",
            "id": 103707,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengodekan operator panah, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getVehiclesCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"4003\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getVehiclesCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4003\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: One body statement",
            "id": 103709,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat fungsi tersebut mengembalikan nilai <code>400</code> dengan menulis arrow function sesingkat mungkin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getVehiclesCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getVehiclesCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>()</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan satu ekspresi, arrow function dapat menghilangkan kurung kurawal dan <code>return</code>. Ekspresi tersebut menjadi hasilnya.</p><p>Buat arrow function tersingkat yang mengembalikan nilai dalam <code>count</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"count\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getVehiclesCount\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"count\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"getVehiclesCount\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getVehiclesCount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>()</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>count</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
