            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil arrow function.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome to Cyprus!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getMessage());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Welcome to Cyprus!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>getMessage</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
